      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.58 (vs ₹0.94 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.58 (down from ₹0.94 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.12b (up 9.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹11.2m (down 34% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.0% (down from 1.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 9% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 2% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
